    Then it has no failure
    And /task on the T1.2 task folder is refused at the start with the R12 line that names T1.2 and T1.1

  @phase1 @core
  Scenario: VF15 The two live-check folders load, before and after ensures becomes required
    Given the example-scenarios and example-cascade spec folders, built in phase 1
